1
00:00:04,637 --> 00:00:06,206
Hey, Eun-ho!

2
00:00:06,906 --> 00:00:08,708
You're here because
of your phone?

3
00:00:09,576 --> 00:00:10,777
Where's Boss?

4
00:00:10,777 --> 00:00:12,979
He went out for business.

5
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:14,847
Why do you ask?

6
00:00:15,348 --> 00:00:16,649
It's better this way.

7
00:00:19,452 --> 00:00:20,787
Can you give this to him?

8
00:00:20,787 --> 00:00:21,921
What is this?

9
00:00:22,155 --> 00:00:23,123
Something I owe him.

10
00:00:23,156 --> 00:00:24,824
By the way, I'm quitting.

11
00:00:24,824 --> 00:00:25,492
What?

12
00:00:25,825 --> 00:00:27,627
I was going to tell him
in person.

13
00:00:27,627 --> 00:00:28,828
But I didn't have my phone.

14
00:00:31,031 --> 00:00:32,332
Thank you for everything.

15
00:00:33,266 --> 00:00:34,267
Have a nice day.

16
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:35,702
But...

17
00:00:35,702 --> 00:00:36,702
Eun-ho!

18
00:00:44,978 --> 00:00:46,980
What now?

19
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:48,782
What am I supposed to do?

20
00:00:49,282 --> 00:00:50,917
Why did you even hide?

21
00:00:51,017 --> 00:00:52,152
That was your chance
to talk to him.

22
00:00:52,152 --> 00:00:54,320
But how can I act calm
after what happened?

23
00:00:54,654 --> 00:00:57,090
"Let's have
a quality time together

24
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:58,691
and talk about yesterday."

25
00:00:58,691 --> 00:01:00,093
I could never say that!

26
00:01:00,093 --> 00:01:01,027
Yeah...

27
00:01:01,027 --> 00:01:01,928
You're right.

28
00:01:01,928 --> 00:01:03,530
I'm screwed!

29
00:01:03,863 --> 00:01:05,364
Maybe this is Karma.

30
00:01:05,765 --> 00:01:08,768
For judging people
and scheming behind them!

31
00:01:09,469 --> 00:01:12,272
I ruined it all!

32
00:01:12,272 --> 00:01:14,474
I messed it all up!

33
00:01:14,474 --> 00:01:15,341
My dating life!

34
00:01:15,341 --> 00:01:16,042
And my flower shop!

35
00:01:16,042 --> 00:01:18,144
It's not over yet.

36
00:01:18,144 --> 00:01:21,147
The flower shop is still here
and I'm still here, too.

37
00:01:21,347 --> 00:01:22,348
Do you want him back?

38
00:01:22,916 --> 00:01:23,416
Yeah.

39
00:01:23,416 --> 00:01:24,717
No matter what it costs?

40
00:01:25,718 --> 00:01:26,786
Then...

41
00:01:26,786 --> 00:01:28,254
Do exactly what I tell you.
